    "overview": "Moore FSM. Outputs Y0 (bit 0 of next state) and z are combinational functions of present state y and input x. Next state Y[2:0] is selected from the state-assigned table based on y and x; Y0 is the least significant bit of that next state. z depends only on present state y.",
